{
  "requirements": [
    "Detect BE block states even when original NBT omits an explicit payload; create native default BE rather than erase furniture.",
    "Create after state placement, rotate native state and BE orientation as needed, load exact payload with transformed coordinates without losing Items/Patterns/name/lock/loot data.",
    "Persist before-image and expected after-image state plus full BE NBT before mutation; restart/resume/ownership and rollback must restore it safely.",
    "Read back normalized native BE NBT including defaults; compare semantically against original explicit payload and document normalization; do not falsely require byte equality of native serialized defaults.",
    "Test all four orientations, chest adjacency/merging, banner facing/patterns, empty barrel/chest inventory access and restore-after-interruption in an isolated world.",
    "Review and explicitly expand static block-state allowlist; BE support alone does not permit unsupported palettes, fluids or dynamic states."
  ],
